                    <span class="micro-title color-white">Solutions</span>
        
                                    <h1 class="heading-1-small has-divider divider-top divider-white color-white mb-4">DAX<sup>®</sup></h1>
                    
                    <p class="sub-heading color-white">The German equity benchmark – for over 30 years</p>
        
                                                <a href="/products/dax-de/" class="btn btn-primary btn-white"><u>Deutsche Version</u></a>
                    
